# ── 백업/임시 폴더 (git에 올리지 않음) ──
*_backup_*/
_preserve_sem2_identity/

# ── 민감 정보: 서명 키, 자격 증명 ──
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
**/key.properties
**/google-services.json
**/GoogleService-Info.plist
**/firebase_options.dart
**/firebase_options.dart.bak_*
**/ios/Runner/GoogleService-Info.plist

# ── Flutter/Dart 빌드 산출물 ──
**/build/
**/.dart_tool/
**/.flutter-plugins
**/.flutter-plugins-dependencies
**/.pub-cache/
**/.pub/
**/doc/api/

# ── 플랫폼별 캐시/ephemeral ──
**/windows/flutter/ephemeral/
**/linux/flutter/ephemeral/
**/macos/Flutter/ephemeral/
**/ios/Flutter/ephemeral/
**/ios/Pods/
**/.symlinks/
**/android/.gradle/
**/android/app/debug/
**/android/app/profile/
**/android/app/release/

# ── IDE ──
.idea/
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/extensions.json

# ── OS ──
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ── 기타 ──
*.log
*.class
*.pyc
*.swp
